DeepSeek Harness RU is an unofficial community localization tool.
DeepSeek and DeepSeek Harness names identify the application being localized;
they do not imply endorsement or affiliation.

The application executable, ASAR archive, Node.js runtime, account data and
user conversations are not included in this distribution.

The translation was validated against DeepSeek Harness 0.1.7-rc.2 and 0.2.0-rc.1 on Windows x64.
Other builds may pass structural checks and be compatible, but compatibility with
all future versions is not guaranteed. New or changed strings may remain in English.
Application code is patched locally from the user's installation.
